sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor DEV as Autor del PR
    participant GH as GitHub Actions
    participant BRK as Servicio intermedio
    participant RES as archetypectl
    participant TM as terramate
    participant GKE as GKE qa

    DEV->>GH: PR (p. ej. nuevo image_digest)
    GH->>RES: resolve --dry-run
    RES-->>GH: binding.tm.hcl + claims
    GH->>TM: generate --check (G0) · conftest (G1) · checkov (G2)
    GH->>BRK: open(ip runner)
    GH->>TM: script run tofu preview · sharing ON · mocks ON
    TM->>GKE: plan (helm, kubernetes)
    GH->>GH: G3 sobre plan.json · comentario en el PR
    GH->>BRK: close(ip)
    DEV->>GH: aprobación + merge
    Note over GH: GitHub Environment qa · revisores obligatorios
    GH->>BRK: open(ip runner)
    GH->>TM: script run tofu deploy · sharing ON · mocks OFF
    TM->>GKE: apply en orden de after
    GH->>BRK: close(ip)
    GH->>GH: sync de la CMDB
